counting-bits.solution:
def count_bits(n):
    bits = [0] * (n + 1)
    for i in range(1, n + 1):
        # i has the same 1 bits as i // 2 (its last bit dropped), plus one if that last bit is 1
        bits[i] = bits[i >> 1] + (i & 1)
    return bits

